# The key the Crawl4AI container sends to OpenCode Go's OpenAI-compatible
# endpoint (https://opencode.ai/inference/go/openai/v1). Take it from the
# OpenCode console, paste it after the = with no quotes, keep the file 0600, then:
#
#   sudo systemctl restart podman-crawl4ai
#
# Without a key the fetch API still works; it just cannot answer a `query` with
# a model, and filter the text by keyword instead.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
